{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"3dc156f462672da3ab2def696c861ccca678594a3cc3d81dc5607e419efb2e34","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"60b80d09d2608ea7f024e0930d456687f827343d435ac0ab8fdcc175a4e4875a","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"685ac97498b9837f2e247677fa1cce598d7039177aa8229ebdd25a647ecd6513","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"6cf5ef442228c9e4418140638803565812227a44e204c6f31e4700aa7f4ce2d8","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"Mechanism mistranslation of the drain clause. In the source (engine 624a6732, game/modules/tome/data/talents/celestial/hymns.lua), Hymn Nocturnalist's do_beams checks getNegative()<drain, then returns early if no foes are within radius 5 (#tgts<=0). Otherwise it calls self:incNegative(-drain) once and fires beams at up to getTargetCount randomly chosen targets. So the drain is paid once per firing, not once per beam. The source text 'drain %0.1f negative energy each time it fires at at least 1 target' says the same thing. The target '每产生一发射线并击中至少一个目标将抽取 %0.1f 负能量' reads as a drain for every beam, which overstates the cost by up to %d times. Suggested wording: '每次向至少一个目标发射射线时抽取'."},{"revision_key":"6f5c282fb8db68e05d6e71ed49a671ff2783b093930ba7d6ca6ed7c68e93cca3","verdict":"OK"}]}